---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
const title = "Website Terms | Arkansas Automated";
const description = "Terms for using the Arkansas Automated public website and submitting a service request.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/terms">
  <SiteNav />
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Terms</span></nav>
    <h1 class="heading-lg">Website terms</h1>
    <p class="fine-print">Last updated November 16, 2026</p>
    <p>This website provides general information about Arkansas Automated services. Submitting a form requests a conversation; it does not create a client relationship or require payment.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Pricing and availability</h2>
    <p>Published prices describe current starting points and may change. Final scope, recurring costs, and payment terms are confirmed directly before purchase or in a written agreement.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Educational information</h2>
    <p>Learning content, calculators, examples, and cost comparisons are general information. They are not legal, financial, medical, tax, or compliance advice, and they do not guarantee a particular business result.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not misuse the website, attempt to interfere with its operation, submit unlawful material, impersonate another person, or probe systems without authorization.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md" id="sms">SMS terms</h2>
    <p><strong>Program.</strong> Arkansas Automated Phone Test updates. When you check the text consent box on a form, Arkansas Automated may text the number you gave about your request: confirming your Phone Test, scheduling and sending your scorecard.</p>
    <p><strong>Frequency and cost.</strong> Message frequency varies, usually a few messages per request. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
    <p><strong>Opt out and help.</strong> Reply STOP to cancel at any time; you will get one message confirming you are opted out. Reply HELP for help, or email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:dre@arkansasautomated.com">dre@arkansasautomated.com</a> or call (479) 492-4232.</p>
    <p><strong>Consent.</strong> Consent to texts is not a condition of any purchase or of getting a Phone Test. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. See the <a class="text-link" href="/privacy#sms">privacy policy</a> for how we handle your number.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Questions</h2>
    <p>Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:dre@arkansasautomated.com">dre@arkansasautomated.com</a> with questions about these website terms. Project-specific rights and obligations belong in the written agreement for that engagement.</p>
  </div></section></main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>
